---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /berlin/index.html
title: Berlin house shortlist
bodyClass: "berlin-homes-page"
robots: "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
externalStyles:
  - https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css
  - /assets/berlin/berlin.css?v=1
pageScripts:
  - https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js
  - /assets/berlin/berlin.js?v=1
---

<main class="berlin-shell">
  <header class="berlin-header">
    <div>
      <p class="berlin-kicker">Berlin rental search · September 2026</p>
      <h1>A house, a garden<br>and room to grow</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="header-aside">
      <p>Current Berlin houses under €10,000/month, prioritising a garage and a substantial private garden.</p>
      <div class="header-stats" aria-label="Shortlist summary">
        <span><strong>{{ berlinHomes | length }}</strong> live listings</span>
        <span><strong>4</strong> strong matches</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="berlin-map-panel" aria-labelledby="berlin-map-title">
    <div class="berlin-map-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="berlin-kicker">Across the city</p>
        <h2 id="berlin-map-title">Where the houses are</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="map-legend" aria-label="Map legend">
        <span><i class="legend-dot strong"></i> Garden + garage</span>
        <span><i class="legend-dot garden"></i> Garden-led alternative</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="berlin-homes-map" class="berlin-homes-map" aria-label="Map of shortlisted Berlin rental houses"></div>
    <p class="precision-note">Markers show neighbourhood or disclosed location. Most portals withhold the street address until contact.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="berlin-listing-section" aria-labelledby="berlin-listing-title">
    <div class="berlin-listing-intro">
      <p class="berlin-kicker">Shortlist</p>
      <h2 id="berlin-listing-title">Open a house</h2>
      <p>Prices reproduce the source listing. “Cold” excludes utilities; “total” and “warm” follow the portal’s advertised figure.</p>
      <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter listings">
        <button type="button" class="is-selected" data-filter="all">All {{ berlinHomes | length }}</button>
        <button type="button" data-filter="strong">Garden + garage</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol id="berlin-home-list" class="berlin-home-list">
      {% for home in berlinHomes %}
        <li data-fit="{{ home.fit }}">
          <a href="{{ home.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-lat="{{ home.latitude }}" data-lon="{{ home.longitude }}">
            <span class="home-number">{% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span class="home-main">
              <span class="home-topline">
                <strong>{{ home.name }}</strong>
                <em class="fit-pill {{ home.fit }}">{% if home.fit == "strong" %}Garden + garage{% else %}Garden alternative{% endif %}</em>
              </span>
              <span class="home-area">{{ home.area }} · {{ home.source }}</span>
              <span class="home-facts">
                <b>{{ home.price }}</b><span>{{ home.rooms }}</span><span>{{ home.livingArea }}</span><span>{{ home.plot }}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="home-features"><span>{{ home.parking }}</span><span>{{ home.garden }}</span></span>
              <small>{{ home.note }}</small>
            </span>
            <span class="home-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <footer class="berlin-footer">
    <p>Checked 20 September 2026 · listings can disappear quickly.</p>
    <p>Map data and approximate positions © OpenStreetMap contributors.</p>
  </footer>
</main>
